Frozen scalar templates and Ruby outputs from the in-repository standard ISA
records, with qc_iu configuration/overlay facts. Includes ISA-manual-derived
specification prose as well as original UDB code/data. No external source was
fetched by the regenerator; raw values are retained without normalization.
